# Scope And Approval

- Allowed without approval:
  - small refactors
  - lint fixes
  - test updates
  - readability improvements
  - internal docs updates
- Requires explicit approval:
  - API changes
  - DB changes
  - infra changes
  - auth changes
  - core data-flow changes
  - creating new files
- Never widen a task beyond the approved goal.
